{{> Start this}}

{{> CustomLogo this}}

{{!--
  A private status page's sign-in link (Types/StatusPage/StatusPageMagicLink),
  sent when somebody asks for one with this address on the page's sign-in
  page - which may not have been its owner, so the closing note says what
  happens if it is ignored. The page's name is chosen by its team, so every
  line that carries it is printed through plainInfo - escaped - never
  through the raw `info`.
--}}

{{> EmailTitle title=(concat "Log in to " statusPageName) }}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "Use the button below to log in to " statusPageName ". You don't need your password.")}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=tokenVerifyUrl buttonText="Log In"}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=tokenVerifyUrl linkLabel="You can also copy and paste this link:"}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "The link works once and expires in " expiresInMinutes " minutes. Asking for another link replaces this one.")}}

{{!-- Where the request came from (Partials/RequestOriginFields.hbs). --}}
{{#if requestedAt}}
{{> InfoBlock info="Details of the request:"}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Requested at:" plainText=requestedAt }}
{{> RequestOriginFields this }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo="If you didn't ask to log in, you can ignore this email. Nobody can log in without the link."}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat statusPageName " Team.")}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> End this}}
